0195: a viewable front-camera picture (bluecam_fll, black level, colour)

Frame length bluecam_fll lines (default 2608: 24 fps, four times 0194's
exposure), exposure 10 lines short of it. The snaps subtract the IMX355
black level (64), take white from the exact 99.5th percentile, balance
red and blue to the green mean (grey world) and apply gamma 2.

